  <item>
    <title>No.005 福建旅行碎碎念</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666b0167c26e396a369605c9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666b0167c26e396a369605c9</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Jun 2024 14:25:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听新一期的一起聊聊天！崽今天崽和V大和大家聊聊旅行的那些事，分享一下我们五一刚刚一起度过的自驾游！最后分享一下一起开开心心旅行的秘诀！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a>💜day1 杭州到霞浦，五一放假堵堵堵！到了霞浦吃滩涂海鲜！春香是什么？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjwiNYTE4EY9MN3geW4sd5b3Gww2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="239">03:59</a>💜day2 霞浦海边溜溜！中午吃吃吃！晚上开到平潭直接追泪！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhKmrV9S3Kn-zf9BXK-9_1wybKXS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a>💜day3 找个小众海滩看日出，终于吃上了金鲟粥！晚上吃平潭特色小吃！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FljujocA08cDnacJ_bqSzEA9Iiwx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a>💜day4 在晒着海带的沙滩漫步！从平潭开去福州吃沙茶面，逛三坊七巷，甘草芭乐好好吃！！再从福州去温州住智能酒店！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvvm4amuKu883PsUpOTvfCk4EQFc.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a>💜day5 温州逛吃准备回程！完美的旅行！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1317">21:57</a> 两个人合不合适，旅行一次就知道了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后祝大家都能和心爱的人用一段又一段开心的旅行填满人生这场漫长的旅途！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmq-Hr5WoWzeAAnDwNz6-4IaL4MA.m4a" length="49695325" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:14</itunes:duration>
